<p>(a) Includes Trump Taj Mahal from acquisition on April 17, 1996.</p>
<p>(c) Loss on joint venture represents the company's 50 percent share of depreciation and amortization of Buffington Harbor Riverboats, LLC.</p>
<p>(d) Loss per share is based upon 22,679,097 shares and 21,577,655 weighted average shares outstanding for the second quarter ended June 30, 1997 and 1996, respectively.  Loss per share for the six months ended June 30, 1997 and 1996, is based upon 23,094,469 and 15,887,106 shares, respectively.</p>
<p>Assuming conversion of Donald J. Trump's interest into 13,918,723 shares and 7,832,345 weighted average shares for the second quarter 1997 and 1996, loss per share would have been $0.14 and $2.01, respectively.  For the six months ended June 30, 1997 and 1996, loss per share would have been $0.73 and $2.99, based on 13,918,723 shares and 7,244,912 weighted average shares outstanding, respectively.</p>
